Data

Fixtures under fixtures/ are generated deterministically by the scripts in the same
directory; they are synthetic and labelled `data_origin=synthetic`. No public robot
dataset bytes and no personal data are redistributed. Datasets fetched at runtime are
described in docs/public-dataset-provenance.md and data/DATA_SOURCES_V21.yaml.
